# wug2.txt deliberately has no final newline. Conflict markers are
# concatenated directly with the original bytes, without adding a newline.
I definitions.inc
> init
<<<
+ wug.txt wug.txt
> add wug.txt
<<<
> commit "base"
<<<
> branch dev
<<<
+ wug.txt notwug.txt
> add wug.txt
<<<
> commit "master version"
<<<
> checkout dev
<<<
+ wug.txt wug2.txt
> add wug.txt
<<<
> commit "dev without final newline"
<<<
> checkout master
<<<
> merge dev
Encountered a merge conflict.
